.TH "cqrs-webhooks-dispatch" 1 "August 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
cqrs-webhooks-dispatch \- Dispatch pending transactional outbox webhooks to subscribers with HMAC-SHA256 signature verification and exponential backoff retries.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php cqrs-webhooks-dispatch
.SH DESCRIPTION
Dispatch pending transactional outbox webhooks to subscribers with HMAC-SHA256 signature verification and exponential backoff retries.
